\title{Inference rules (mathpartir)}
\import{base-macros}
\tag{feature-demo}

\p{Natural-deduction and typing rules via the \code{infrule} macro (the LaTeX
\code{mathpartir} package). Here, the simply-typed lambda calculus:}

\infrule{
  \inferrule*[right=Var]{
    x : \tau \in \Gamma
  }{
    \Gamma \vdash x : \tau
  }
  \and
  \inferrule*[right=Abs]{
    \Gamma, x : \tau_1 \vdash e : \tau_2
  }{
    \Gamma \vdash \lambda x.\,e : \tau_1 \to \tau_2
  }
  \and
  \inferrule*[right=App]{
    \Gamma \vdash e_1 : \tau_1 \to \tau_2 \\
    \Gamma \vdash e_2 : \tau_1
  }{
    \Gamma \vdash e_1\,e_2 : \tau_2
  }
}
